            "notes": "At this point, you're shopping for raw Weapon Power / Attack Speed. Ideally, you'll be sitting right around $12k... but here's a handy-dandy grocery list for each cash bracket:\n\n**$8,000**\\\n[Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) \\\n[Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) \\\n[Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)\n\n**$9,500**\\\n[Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) \\\n[Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34) \\\n[Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) \\\n[Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)\n\n**$10,750**\\\n[Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) \\\n[Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) \\\n[Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)\n\n**$11,750**\\\n[Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) \\\n[Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) \\\n[Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) \\\n[Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)\n\n**$13,250**\\\n[Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) \\\n[Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) \\\n[Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) \\\n[Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) \\\n[Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34)\n\n**$15,750**\\\n[Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) \\\n[Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) \\\n[Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2) \\\n[Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) \\\n[Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)",
