            "created_at": "2025-08-26T00:33:46.36083+00:00",
            "notes": "Alright! Now that you have 100 \"free\" Armor from [Frost Armor](item_f9925f6e-bb6a-4de6-bb86-622583d60779) on top of Mei's high baseline Health, the Life regeneration from [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) will be especially potent. At first, it'll take ~18 seconds of primary fire uptime to fully stack your Armor, at which point you'll be permanently regenerating ~13 Life per second. Both of these numbers will improve as your stats increase each round.\n\nThe passive regeneration is *not* going to make you incredibly tanky on its own. The reason why it's so good is because it's *always* ticking. Every precious moment that you spend at less than 100% Life, you're getting value from it. That gives it an extreme advantage over Lifesteal when it comes to self-sufficiency.\n\nThat said, this build *does* also feature active healing via [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643). You'll be gaining more Weapon Power and Attack Speed every round, but even just at a baseline, this item will heal you for ~17 Life per second as long as you're spraying an enemy with your primary fire. Even better, if you've already been Martian Mended up to full, shooting enemies will grant you an extra buffer of up to 100 Overhealth.\n\nFor frame of reference, Mercy's healing beam restores 60 Life per second. So between the passive regeneration and the Lifesteal, that means playing this build is like being pocketed by half a Mercy! And though it's not integral to the game plan, getting 10% Cooldown Reduction and 10% Ability Power is a neat little bonus.\n\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\n\nFrom this point on, your shopping follows a priority system. Go down the list from top to bottom. If you can afford it, buy it. If you can't, buy the next best thing. Sell your blues and greens each round and repeat the process.\n\n+ $10,000 - [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) \\\n+ $10,000 - [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) \\\n+ $10,000 - [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) \\\n+ $14,000 - [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) \\\n+ $11,000 - [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) \\\n+ $14,500 - [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) \\\n+ $4,500 - [Technoleech](item_cb7fd8bf-bdcc-439a-ad35-372f24a027a8) \\\n+ $3,750 - [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) \\\n+ $6,000 - [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) \\\n+ $1,000 - [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) \\\n+ $1,500 - [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) \\\n+ $1,000 - [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)",
